    ["e", "Locating buried utilities before digging helps a repair crew avoid striking other lines.", true, "Marked utility locations are checked before any excavation to repair a sewer."],
    ["e", "Wearing gloves makes washing hands unnecessary after wastewater work.", false, "Hands are washed before eating or drinking even when gloves were worn, because gloves can leak or be touched on removal."],
    ["m", "A high-level alarm in a wet well signals that the station is working normally.", false, "A high-level alarm warns that pumps are not keeping up or have failed, so staff must respond before an overflow occurs."]
